# Docs-only repo: no application runtime, no browser UI, no tests/e2e/, no Playwright command.
# Record browser e2e as SKIP N/A via existing VERIFY_SKIP. This is rationale, not an e2e PASS
# and not a failed-case waiver. Security scans (gitleaks, semgrep) must still pass.
VERIFY_E2E_CMD=playwright
VERIFY_SKIP=playwright
VERIFY_SKIP_REASON=browser e2e N/A: no application runtime, no tests/e2e/, no configured Playwright command
